0..75 Comment "// The twin of `model/layouts/rust-default.gandr`: a field that is itself a"
76..148 Comment "// struct is no scalar, so its type has no code yet. rustc groups such a"
149..222 Comment "// field by a pseudo-alignment its size derives, which the program models"
223..278 Comment "// once it runs over levitated codes, where codes nest."
